Cold-build mixed integer autograd and run its seven outer native checks. All
production Tensor arithmetic and ownership run in the native HIA image. The
unchanged producer executes five gates; six independent commands then check
source custody, owner roles, resources, entry capacities and typed handoff.
Live32 and complete accounted35 remain separate required CI gates. This entry
has no existing-mixed-image or producer-report reuse option.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --repo REPO
  --parent-build PARENT_BUILD
  --upstream UPSTREAM
  --compiler COMPILER
  --linker LINKER
  --flat-compiler FLAT_COMPILER
  --stack-build STACK_BUILD
  --output OUTPUT
